# Run r1103 phase 2 rerun 2 (p2_R2): BATCH-FAULT and diagnostic rows of the s5r block (perf/runs/r1103/p2/judged.md,
# section "s5r / s5b"). NOT RUN. Independent of p2_R.qb.
# Boot 1, FRESH group A superflat (as drive_p2.sh step RA):
#   bash tools/scratch_query/prep_srv.sh $SCR/s5r2 s5r2 A difficulty=normal spawn-monsters=true spawn-animals=true spawn-protection=16
#   probes: tools/fungi_probe/zcount.js:zz_count.js  tools/scratch_query/s5_probe.js:zz_s5_probe.js (zz_zq_probe.js from prep_srv.sh)
#   toml (creativedelight-common.toml): stem_fruit secondFruitMinutes / thirdFruitMinutes / fourthFruitMinutes 0,
#   maxFruits 3, fertileSoilBoost false
#   qrun.py run $SCR/s5r2 tools/scratch_query/batches/r1103/p2_R2.qb perf/runs/r1103/p2R2 --rows S5R2-00,SQ-PSF-08a,SQ-RB-21b,SQ-DRK-04,SQ-PSF-02,SQ-FCB-07c,S5RA-PSF-bot,SQ-PSF-08
#   (SQ-PSF-08 waits until 600 s after SQ-PSF-08a; about 14 min in all)
# Boot 2, same level: stop, set stem_fruit fertileSoilBoost true, boot, then
#   qrun.py run $SCR/s5r2 tools/scratch_query/batches/r1103/p2_R2.qb perf/runs/r1103/p2R2 --rows S5R2-00,S5RA-PSF-bot,SQ-PSF-08b   (about 7 min)
pace 2


## S5R2-00 | setup (copy of S5RA-00): home marker, clock, weather, no mob spawning, far site forceload (not a queue row)
bootexpect Done \(
> execute unless entity @e[type=minecraft:marker,tag=s5home] run summon minecraft:marker ~ ~ ~ {Tags:["s5home"]}
sleep 2
> data get entity @e[type=minecraft:marker,tag=s5home,limit=1] Pos
capture S5H entity data: \[(-?\d+)\.\d+d, (-?\d+)\.\d+d, (-?\d+)\.\d+d\]
> gamerule doDaylightCycle false
> time set noon
> gamerule doWeatherCycle false
> weather clear 1000000
> gamerule doPatrolSpawning false
> gamerule doTraderSpawning false
> gamerule doMobSpawning false
> kill @e[type=!minecraft:player,type=!minecraft:marker]
> difficulty normal
> forceload add {S5H1+384} {S5H3-16} {S5H1+432} {S5H3+48}
sleep 5
> say S5R2 setup done
expect S5R2 setup done
reject (Unknown (item|block|block type|entity)|does not (have|accept)|Incorrect argument for command|Unknown or incomplete command|That position is not loaded|No player was found|no such bot|no such item|Invalid (block state|tag)|\[(zq|s5)\] (error|no player))

